libwildlifesystems (1.0.0) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * JSON utilities: ws_json_escape_string, ws_json_replace_null_*
  * Prototype caching: ws_get_sc_prototype, ws_get_prototype_cached
  * Command handlers: ws_cmd_identify, ws_cmd_list_single, ws_cmd_list_multiple
  * System utilities: ws_get_serial_number, ws_validate_gpio_pin
  * Standard exit codes: WS_EXIT_SUCCESS, WS_EXIT_IDENTIFY, WS_EXIT_INVALID_ARG
  * Location filter enum: WS_LOCATION_ALL, WS_LOCATION_INTERNAL, WS_LOCATION_EXTERNAL

